 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "scene": "open",
   "start": 1.2,
   "dur": 2.847,
   "text": "Every college has a moment it's remembered for."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "scene": "open",
   "start": 4.367,
   "dur": 3.004,
   "text": "For some, it comes once in a generation."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "shift",
   "start": 8.371,
   "dur": 1.881,
   "text": "That moment is now."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "shift",
   "start": 10.752,
   "dur": 6.269,
   "text": "From 2026\u201327, artificial intelligence enters every year of B.Pharm."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "shift",
   "start": 17.342,
   "dur": 4.362,
   "text": "Six new papers. Every pharmacy college must teach them."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "insp",
   "start": 22.904,
   "dur": 1.411,
   "text": "Imagine the inspection."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "insp",
   "start": 24.635,
   "dur": 4.127,
   "text": "One simple question: \u201cHow are you teaching AI?\u201d"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "insp",
   "start": 29.862,
   "dur": 1.724,
   "text": "And a silence in the room."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "parent",
   "start": 32.986,
   "dur": 5.251,
   "text": "Imagine the admission desk. A father asks: \u201cWill my daughter learn AI here?\u201d"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "parent",
   "start": 38.557,
   "dur": 2.194,
   "text": "And then he walks to the college next door."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "student",
   "start": 42.051,
   "dur": 3.082,
   "text": "Imagine your students, brilliant in pharmacy,"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "student",
   "start": 45.453,
   "dur": 4.833,
   "text": "in their first interview, unable to answer one question about AI."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "teacher",
   "start": 51.586,
   "dur": 3.004,
   "text": "You did the right thing. You hired a teacher."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "teacher",
   "start": 54.91,
   "dur": 6.531,
   "text": "One teacher. Six new papers. Four years of students."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "teacher",
   "start": 61.761,
   "dur": 4.676,
   "text": "Then, one day, in the middle of the semester, the chair is empty."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "teacher",
   "start": 66.757,
   "dur": 3.866,
   "text": "And everything they built walks out of the door with them."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "scene": "black",
   "start": 72.123,
   "dur": 1.724,
   "text": "Who carries your college then?"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "scene": "turn",
   "start": 75.547,
   "dur": 1.646,
   "text": "But imagine the other story."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "scene": "tongue",
   "start": 78.493,
   "dur": 4.598,
   "text": "Your students learning AI in their mother tongue, the language they dream in,"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "scene": "tongue",
   "start": 83.41,
   "dur": 2.847,
   "text": "just as NEP 2020 envisions."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "scene": "teacher2",
   "start": 87.358,
   "dur": 5.878,
   "text": "Your teacher, never alone. Every lesson ready. Every practical prepared."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "scene": "teacher2",
   "start": 93.555,
   "dur": 4.206,
   "text": "Teachers may come and go. Your college's strength stays."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "scene": "naac",
   "start": 98.861,
   "dur": 2.194,
   "text": "Inspectors leave impressed."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "scene": "naac",
   "start": 101.375,
   "dur": 9.639,
   "text": "And at NAAC, you present the evidence: modern teaching, measurable learning, a best practice that's yours."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "scene": "parents",
   "start": 112.114,
   "dur": 5.068,
   "text": "Parents leave your campus saying: \u201cThis college is ready for the future.\u201d"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "scene": "fame",
   "start": 118.482,
   "dur": 2.194,
   "text": "Your college's name in the newspapers."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "scene": "fame",
   "start": 120.996,
   "dur": 2.847,
   "text": "Other colleges coming to learn from you."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "scene": "fame",
   "start": 124.164,
   "dur": 5.068,
   "text": "Your students carrying your name into hospitals, industry and research."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "scene": "fame",
   "start": 129.551,
   "dur": 0.993,
   "text": "Not following."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "scene": "fame",
   "start": 131.094,
   "dur": 1.228,
   "text": "Leading."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "scene": "proof",
   "start": 134.322,
   "dur": 7.001,
   "text": "It has already begun. A hundred pharmacy students in Bagalkot are learning this way, today."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "scene": "cta",
   "start": 142.523,
   "dur": 3.788,
   "text": "We're choosing only a few founding partner colleges this year."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "scene": "cta",
   "start": 146.63,
   "dur": 4.362,
   "text": "In ten years, people will ask which college led the way."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "scene": "cta",
   "start": 151.313,
   "dur": 1.567,
   "text": "Let the answer be yours."
  }
 ]
}